41653::$$$message_0322_0000_0000$$$::"This is Avenger, the eighth Servant.[lr]::
41654::$$$message_0322_0000_0001$$$::The Servant of vengeance. After taking a serious look at him...[br]...I can't find the right words."::
41655::$$$message_0322_0001_0000$$$::"'His concept was a dark Shirou. We started with him wearing Shirou as an outer shell, and then adjusted him to be somewhat more Japanese,' says the character artist."::
41656::$$$message_0322_0002_0000$$$::"The silhouette on the left looks simple at a glance, but it has a rather meandering outline."[skip_next_tag][br]::
41657::$$$message_0322_0003_0000$$$::"The design incorporates both a lack of individuality that makes it hard to identify and a bizarreness that can't be ignored. Add on some space alien horns and kaiju dorsal fins, and it becomes awfully..."::
41658::$$$message_0322_0004_0000$$$::"So don't get me wrong[line len=2][br][cacheimage storage=アーチャー神主01h(中),凛巫女服01i(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=アーチャー神主01h(中),凛巫女服01i(中)] They didn't cut any corners, [wvl canskip=0 time=400]not at all![br][wwvlait canskip=0 time=400] You hear me!?"::

